onymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/99423db91c5d3cfac73d98cec027e92f.poster.avif?t=1753455210\" width=423 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573410/extras/99423db91c5d3cfac73d98cec027e92f.webm?t=1753455210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name: Yaka Sharoku (English: Sherok Holmes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tGender: Female</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tAge: 27</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tHeight: 158 cm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBlood Type: AB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBirthday: January 6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tProfession: Consulting Private Detective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tThe only police-affiliated consulting detective in Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBorn in London, Sharok graduated top of her class in law at the University of Cambridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tShe specializes in psychology, anthropology, and forensic science, and has solved numerous difficult cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tOfficial records suggest she may be descended from the brother of the legendary Holmes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tOutwardly, she might seem easygoing or even flirtatious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tBut in truth, she is a steadfast guardian of justice\u2014just like her famous ancestors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Also known as:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb\u300aSHEROK \u7684\u8a18\u61b6\u6a94\u6848\u300b (Traditional Chinese / \u7e41\u9ad4\u4e2d\u6587)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb\u300aSHEROK\u7684\u8bb0\u5fc6\u6863\u6848\u300b (Simplified Chinese / \u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >